d 'GLEMB': module to provide general location EMB imputation engine
d
d      The recommended user interface is mi impute glemb.  It uses
d Stata's official mi impute machinery to manage imputation
d storage,    styles, add(), replace, and rseed().    The
d standalone glemb command remains available as a development and
d diagnostic interface.  It saves completed datasets to disk	and
d is retained mainly for testing and comparison with earlier
d development runs. 
d
d KW: multiple imputation
d KW: missing data
d KW: general location model
d KW: EMB
d KW: proper imputation
d KW: bootstrap
d
d Requires: Stata version 17
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260924
d
d Author: Paul D. Allison,  Statistical Horizons
d Support: email  allison@@statisticalhorizons.com
d
f glemb.ado
f glemb.sthlp
f ../l/lglemb.mata
f ../m/mi_impute_cmd_glemb.ado
f ../m/mi_impute_cmd_glemb_cleanup.ado
f ../m/mi_impute_cmd_glemb_parse.ado
f ../m/mi_impute_glemb.sthlp
